  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request Path",
      "items": [
        "Ingress terminates HTTPS and forwards /docintake to the gateway, now over TLS to port 8443 (httproute.yaml:17-28)",
        "A BackendTLSPolicy makes the Gateway check the API's certificate against the release's private CA (backendtlspolicy.yaml:5)",
        "The API key is checked before the extract handler runs (DocumentEndpoints.cs:49)",
        "Failures are thrown, not caught in the endpoints: one exception handler answers them (ProblemMapping.cs:22)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Dapr",
      "items": [
        "Every service pod runs a Dapr sidecar (not drawn). The gateway calls the scan, document and extraction services as http://localhost:3500/v1.0/invoke/<app id>/method; the sidecars carry it over mutual TLS on port 50002 (api-deployment.yaml:75-114)",
        "Each callee's Configuration denies everything and allows only the API's app id and the operations it uses (dapr-config.yaml:25)",
        "The control plane runs in dapr-system in the same cluster and is installed once per cluster before the chart: Sentry issues every sidecar's certificate, the injector adds the sidecars. The CI deploy stops if it is missing (deploy/README.md:122, ci.yml:195-202)",
        "Callee pods accept the API only on 50002 and may reach dapr-system; the 8080 app port stays on the pod's loopback (networkpolicy.yaml:6-55)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Every upload goes to the scan service, which asks clamd over the pod's loopback, before any parser reads it; an infection is refused with 422 (DocumentPipeline.cs:50-55, clamav.yaml:88-89)",
        "Parsers run only in the document service, which has no egress (DocumentClassifier.cs:49, LocalPageRasterizer.cs:138-144)",
        "Only the extraction service holds the model key and reaches the internet (ArchitectureTests.cs:118-130)",
        "The gateway carries no model provider library (ArchitectureTests.cs:96-100)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Usage and Telemetry",
      "items": [
        "Each model call is queued and written to a SQLite file on a PVC (UsageStore.cs:19, api-pvc.yaml:5)",
        "Services send OTLP over TLS to the collector, which re-reads its certificate on renewal; it alone holds the Honeycomb ingest key (collector-config.yaml:23-25, 41)",
        "Production is not yet verified: the BackendTLSPolicy and Honeycomb ingestion over the TLS collector are untested on the cluster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not Shown",
      "items": [
        "The Dapr sidecars are not drawn; the 'Dapr mTLS' labels stand for sidecar to sidecar calls. The control plane is joined to one service although Sentry serves every sidecar, and its operator, placement and scheduler are not named in the box (deploy/README.md:122)",
        "cert-manager and the private CA that sign the API and collector certificates are not drawn (internal-ca.yaml:20)",
        "The decisions service was removed; /api/feedback/analyze answers 503 (FeedbackEndpoints.cs:13-18)",
        "Local dotnet run turns scanning off in appsettings.Development.json (line 13); Compose and Helm turn it on, and Compose has no Dapr or TLS",
        "The analyze route dispatches to stub agents, not real downstream agents (Program.cs:34)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}